$runtime_checks

# Direct single-pass x86-64 baseline emitter for default-mode builds.
# Emits machine code directly into x64_encode's code buffer, bypassing IrFn
# construction, default-mode optimization, backend_analyze, x64_allocate, and
# x64_emit. Any unsupported function or helper returns false and falls back to
# the ordinary IR lowering pipeline with identical semantics.

